WEBVTT

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:06.492
(PANTING)

00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:08.052
(WHIMPERING)

00:00:09.932 --> 00:00:11.972
SQUISHY: This is crazy.
We're going to get arrested!

00:00:12.052 --> 00:00:13.092
(MIKE SHUSHING)

00:00:18.172 --> 00:00:20.332
-Oh, wow.
-Whoa...

00:00:20.412 --> 00:00:21.492
Oh! (CHUCKLES)

00:00:21.572 --> 00:00:23.692
FEMALE MONSTER ON PA:
All Scare Floors now active.

00:00:23.852 --> 00:00:27.532
West coast coming online.
Scarers coming out.

00:00:29.492 --> 00:00:30.492
SQUISHY: Look at them.

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:32.212
They're going into the human world,

00:00:32.372 --> 00:00:34.372
and they don't even look scared!

00:00:35.372 --> 00:00:36.852
(CHILD SCREAMS)

00:00:37.772 --> 00:00:38.892
-(BEEPS)
-Wow.

00:00:39.132 --> 00:00:41.252
Take a good look, fellas.

00:00:41.532 --> 00:00:43.212
See what they all have in common?

00:00:45.892 --> 00:00:47.452
Uh... No, not really.

00:00:47.532 --> 00:00:50.972
Exactly. There's no one type of Scarer.

00:00:51.372 --> 00:00:54.292
The best Scarers use their differences
to their advantage.

00:00:55.732 --> 00:00:57.452
-(SNARLS)
-Wow.

00:00:57.572 --> 00:00:59.212
Terri? Look.

00:01:04.092 --> 00:01:05.132
DON: (CHUCKLES) Hey!

00:01:05.332 --> 00:01:07.972
Look at that old feller
racking up the big numbers!

00:01:08.052 --> 00:01:11.252
Don, that old fella is
Earl "The Terror" Thompson!

00:01:11.332 --> 00:01:13.732
What? Where? That's really him?

00:01:13.812 --> 00:01:16.052
MIKE: He held the Scare Record
for three years!

00:01:16.412 --> 00:01:18.212
Oh! Third door from the end!

00:01:18.292 --> 00:01:20.652
MIKE: Carla "Killer Claws" Benitez!

00:01:20.732 --> 00:01:22.892
SULLEY: Look!
It's "Screaming" Bob Gunderson!

00:01:23.252 --> 00:01:24.852
-I still have his rookie card.
-Me, too!

00:01:24.932 --> 00:01:26.292
Doesn't have the speed anymore,
but his

00:01:26.372 --> 00:01:28.732
-technique is flawless.
-Technique is flawless.

00:01:30.092 --> 00:01:31.692
You collected Scare Cards, huh?

00:01:31.812 --> 00:01:33.532
Yep. 450 of them.

00:01:33.612 --> 00:01:36.412
Impressive.
I have 6,000 still in mint condition,

00:01:36.492 --> 00:01:38.012
but, you know, 450 is pretty good, too.

00:01:38.092 --> 00:01:40.412
Hey, look at me!
I'm Earl "The Terror" Thompson!

00:01:40.492 --> 00:01:41.892
-(ROARS)
-Whoa! (CHUCKLES)

00:01:41.972 --> 00:01:43.172
Oh, that's great!

00:01:43.852 --> 00:01:45.812
DON: That's a pretty good one, Squish.

00:01:49.772 --> 00:01:51.092
I've been a real jerk.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:53.812
So have I.

00:01:56.052 --> 00:01:57.172
But it's not too late.

00:01:58.612 --> 00:02:00.412
We could be a great team.

00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:02.572
We just need to start working together.

00:02:04.932 --> 00:02:06.092
-SECURITY GUARD: Hey!
-(GASPS)

00:02:07.092 --> 00:02:08.092
What are you doing up there?

00:02:08.772 --> 00:02:10.052
I can't go back to jail!

00:02:10.132 --> 00:02:11.132
(YELPS)

00:02:12.172 --> 00:02:13.212
(ALARM BLARING)

00:02:14.372 --> 00:02:15.372
Come on!

00:02:15.452 --> 00:02:16.852
DON: They're right behind us!

00:02:16.932 --> 00:02:18.052
(ALL PANTING)

00:02:20.972 --> 00:02:21.972
Get back here!

00:02:22.252 --> 00:02:23.252
(GASPS)

00:02:27.372 --> 00:02:28.532
(GASPS)

00:02:28.772 --> 00:02:29.892
Up there! Get them!

00:02:30.252 --> 00:02:32.052
-(ALL GRUNTING)
-ART: Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:32.132 --> 00:02:33.332
-(WHIMPERS)
-(GRUNTS)

00:02:33.852 --> 00:02:35.532
-Thanks, brother!
-Don't mention it.

00:02:35.972 --> 00:02:37.372
(COUGHING)

00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:41.492
I'm fine, really!
It's just a little heart attack.

00:02:41.972 --> 00:02:43.972
Aw... I want a piece of that action!

00:02:44.052 --> 00:02:45.572
(GRUNTING)

00:02:45.892 --> 00:02:47.172
(ALARM RINGING)

00:02:50.612 --> 00:02:51.652
(ALL PANTING)

00:02:55.412 --> 00:02:57.332
SQUISHY: Mom! Start the car!

00:02:57.412 --> 00:02:58.492
(BOTH GRUNTING)

00:02:58.812 --> 00:03:00.692
-What?
-Start the car!

00:03:00.892 --> 00:03:02.092
Stop the bar?

00:03:02.332 --> 00:03:04.292
The car! Start the car!

00:03:04.532 --> 00:03:05.692
Oh! Okay.

00:03:05.892 --> 00:03:07.332
(CAR ENGINE STARTS)

00:03:07.852 --> 00:03:09.252
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

00:03:09.332 --> 00:03:10.332
Get in! Get in!

00:03:10.812 --> 00:03:12.612
-Mom, go!
-Seatbelts.

00:03:13.652 --> 00:03:15.852
-Okay, go!
-Does anyone want gum?

00:03:15.932 --> 00:03:16.932
Just drive!

00:03:17.652 --> 00:03:18.892
Okay. Here we go!

00:03:20.932 --> 00:03:21.932
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:03:23.572 --> 00:03:26.852
ART: Oh, yeah!
Let's break in somewhere else!

00:03:27.812 --> 00:03:29.172
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:48.092 --> 00:03:49.972
-(ALARM BUZZING)
-(SULLEY SNORING)

00:03:50.052 --> 00:03:51.892
-Rise and shine!
-(GASPING)

00:03:52.372 --> 00:03:55.132
Scary feet, scary feet...
The kid is in the bathroom!

00:03:55.212 --> 00:03:57.092
Scary feet, scary feet...
Oh, he's back!

00:03:57.212 --> 00:03:58.732
-(ALL ROAR)
-(ALARM BUZZING)

00:03:59.052 --> 00:04:00.052
-Wake up!
-(GASPING)

00:04:00.732 --> 00:04:02.092
-(ROARING)
-Thirty-seven! Thirty-eight!

00:04:02.492 --> 00:04:03.652
Do I hear thirty-nine?

00:04:03.732 --> 00:04:05.012
-MIKE: Come on!
-(SULLEY CONTINUES ROARING)

00:04:05.092 --> 00:04:06.932
MIKE: Yes! Okay, Oozma Kappa,
you're looking good.

00:04:08.572 --> 00:04:10.492
"To frighten a child
is the point of a Scare.

00:04:10.572 --> 00:04:13.332
"If you frighten a teen,
then Scarer beware."

00:04:13.772 --> 00:04:16.172
-Okay, scare the little kid.
-(ROARS)

00:04:16.252 --> 00:04:18.172
-Avoid the teenager!
-(GASPS)

00:04:23.452 --> 00:04:24.852
FEMALE TEENAGER 1:
I'm on the phone!

00:04:25.012 --> 00:04:26.092
-(BUZZING)
-(GROANS)

00:04:26.212 --> 00:04:27.212
MALE TEENAGER 1:
No one understands me!

00:04:27.292 --> 00:04:28.292
-(ROARS)
-(BUZZES)

00:04:28.412 --> 00:04:29.412
-MALE TEENAGER 2: Whatever.
-(ROARS)

00:04:30.412 --> 00:04:31.412
-(BUZZES)
-(GROANS)

00:04:35.652 --> 00:04:37.012
FEMALE TEENAGER 2:
But, Daddy, I love him!

00:04:37.092 --> 00:04:38.132
(BELL DINGS)

00:04:41.012 --> 00:04:42.452
-(ROARS)
-(CHILD SCREAMS)

00:04:43.732 --> 00:04:45.532
MALE ANNOUNCER:
First place, Roar Omega Roar!

00:04:45.612 --> 00:04:47.572
Second place, Oozma Kappa!

00:04:47.652 --> 00:04:48.772
Whoo!

00:04:49.292 --> 00:04:50.492
MALE ANNOUNCER: Third place, HSS.

00:04:50.732 --> 00:04:51.972
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:04:54.612 --> 00:04:55.812
MALE TEENAGER 3: You're lame.

00:04:58.052 --> 00:04:59.652
"Someone is coming,
this could ruin your night.

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:02.012
"Stay hidden, take cover,
and stay out of sight!"

00:05:02.092 --> 00:05:03.452
You got 10 seconds. Go!

00:05:05.852 --> 00:05:08.852
Kiosk! Pile of leaves!
Standing out in the open.

00:05:09.652 --> 00:05:10.852
And there should be one more.

00:05:10.932 --> 00:05:12.852
(WHISTLES) How did I do?

00:05:13.332 --> 00:05:14.652
Oh! Not too shabby, Don!

00:05:14.972 --> 00:05:17.132
Thanks! I cannot get down.

00:05:17.652 --> 00:05:18.892
-Zombie snarl!
-(SNARLING)

00:05:18.972 --> 00:05:20.932
Angry poodle. Jazz clown.

00:05:21.012 --> 00:05:22.172
-My Aunt Phyllis.
-(GROANING)

00:05:22.292 --> 00:05:23.292
In the morning.

00:05:23.372 --> 00:05:24.572
That's what I'm talking about!

00:05:29.652 --> 00:05:30.852
(SCREAMS)

00:05:31.172 --> 00:05:32.292
(GROANS)

00:05:33.012 --> 00:05:34.172
(LAUGHING)

00:05:35.172 --> 00:05:37.092
-(ALARM BUZZES)
-Time to go to work.

